        <p>March 28.—itichmonds v. Cairo-street. „ 28.—Fletchers v. Padgate. „ 28.—Monks Hall v. Crosfields. „ 31.—Cairo-street v.Wa:rrington. „ 31.—Padgate v. Crosfleld's. These conclude the League fixtures. Cairo-street have two important engagements, but if they win only one it will ensure their position at the head of the League table, as first winners of the new cup.</p>
