        <p>ITS MARVELLOUS EFFECT UPON THY STOMACH, LIVER, KIDNEYS AND BLOOD. SEA.-WEED possesses a natural strengthening, healing, and purifying power, infinitely greater than ordinary medicines. This is now regarded as conclusive by eminent authorities, who recommend it daily since Veno's Sea-weed Tonic was first introduced. A pure palatable extract of Sea-weed is one of the principle ingredients Of Veno's Sea- weed Tonic. This remedy excels in the cure of INDIGESTION, WIND, HEADACHE, NERVOUS COMPLAINTS, KIDNEY TROUBLES, WEAK AND PAINFUL BACK, TORPID LIVER, FEMALE TROUBLES, POORNESS OF BLOOD and" HABITUAL , CON- TIPATION." ltt! anind Kidney ost brilliant CoMplaints.The remarkable effect is produced in Stomach, Live cures Veno's Seaweed Tonic effect even in the worst cases is positiveproof of its therapeutic value. Ask for VENO'S SEA-WEED TONIC, is. lid. and 2s. 9d. per bottle, at Chemists and Drug Stores.</p>
